'''Damp '''is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by [[Crafting/Salvaging|crafting]] it or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade is ocean blue in color with a watery texture over it, along with water droplets visibly seen on the blade. Its guard is light blue-green, and the handle is dark blue.

== Trivia ==
* Players can exchange 12 uncommon [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain it by chance.
* When salvaged, it grants 2 rare shards.

